# Catalog refs

Follow the project skill `.cursor/skills/add-catalog-ref/SKILL.md`. Product notes: `docs/catalog-refs.md`.

- Mint/validate only through `core/ref` (`Mint`, `Validate`). Do not hand-roll tokens or mint in SQL.
- Machine id stays UUIDv7; `ref` is display/search only — never a foreign key; never recycle.
- Reserved prefixes: `USR`, `SRC`, `ART`, `CIT`, `OBS`. Validate Node Type prefixes with `ref.ValidatePrefix`.
- One ref format. Interpretation Nodes are ordinary refs off `node_types.candidate_ref_prefix` (`CPR-…`), canonical entities off `ref_prefix` (`PER-…`) — no marker segment, no candidate-specific mint or validator.
